theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 22
text = "HOW TO PLAY

• The ball falls from above.
• If the ball hits the ground, you lose a life.
• You have 3 lives.
• Press SHIFT to leap to the other side.
• Your cat flips automatically when landing.
• If the cat's head hits the ball, it bounces and you earn 1 point.
• The ball and the cat speed up with each point.
• The challenge is timing your leap just right.

SHIFT restarts after losing.
ESCAPE returns to the menu.

"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

